r_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2726258933/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2726265184","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102968#issuecomment-2726265184","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102968","id":2726265184,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6if4Fg","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-15T06:16:20Z","updated_at":"2025-03-15T06:16:20Z","body":"The only option is to use the Metal Frame debugger in XCode. It has a really excellent profiler built in that will give you detailed information on what the GPU is spending time on","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2726265184/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3225667878","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102968#issuecomment-3225667878","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102968","id":3225667878,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7AQ8km","user":{"login":"lucasmaffazioli","id":12513049,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNTEzMDQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12513049?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasmaffazioli","html_url":"https://github.com/lucasmaffazioli","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasmaffazioli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasmaffazioli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasmaffazioli/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasmaffazioli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasmaffazioli/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasmaffazioli/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasmaffazioli/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasmaffazioli/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucasmaffazioli/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-26T20:41:38Z","updated_at":"2025-08-26T20:41:38Z","body":"This also happens on 4.4.1 stable with a 2D project","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3225667878/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3425755025","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102968#issuecomment-3425755025","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102968","id":3425755025,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7MMN-R","user":{"login":"iamvoidcoder","id":81540569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxNTQwNTY5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81540569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamvoidcoder","html_url":"https://github.com/iamvoidcoder","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamvoidcoder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamvoidcoder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamvoidcoder/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamvoidcoder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamvoidcoder/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamvoidcoder/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamvoidcoder/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamvoidcoder/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iamvoidcoder/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-21T10:05:23Z","updated_at":"2025-10-21T10:05:23Z","body":"> This is mentioned in the description of https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/88199 as a known limitation:\n> \n> The Visual Profiler and GPU frame times are not supported, as Godot's timestamp-based timing mechanism is not compatible with TBDR GPUs like Apple's M-series and mobile GPUs. Apple GPUs can reorder render passes based on input and output dependencies.\n> However, it should be mentioned in the class reference and optimization manual. We can also make RenderingServer.viewport_set_measure_render_time_gpu(true) print a warning when using Metal.\n> \n\nHaving just stumbled on this myself, it is not an actual technical limitation of Metal itself @Calinou. There are ways to measure timing on Metal. First there is the is the basic Metal command buffer completion handler:\n\n```\n[commandBuffer addCompletedHandler:^(id<MTLCommandBuffer> commandBuffer) {\n    CFTimeInterval start = commandBuffer.GPUStartTime;\n    CFTimeInterval end = commandBuffer.GPUEndTime;\n    CFTimeInterval gpuRuntimeDuration = end - start;\n    ...\n}];\n```\n \nThen it also has full detailed frame capture support via  MTLCaptureManager.\n\n\n\n\n ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3425755025/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6333290196","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102968#issuecomment-6333290196","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102968","id":6333290196,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABeX5W1A","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-22T05:13:42Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T05:13:42Z","body":"Fixed in 4.8 via the following, which enabled GPU timestamps:\n\n- #121392\n\n> [!NOTE]\n>\n> This won't be back ported, as it's a complex change.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6333290196/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]